# Projectiles trade: p1's mid 236c and p2's low 236d fly at different heights, pass each other without clashing and
# hit both fighters on frame 43. Under the "trade" rule (the data default) both hits land. Both fighters are still in
# their special's recovery, so both hits are punish counters (+4 hitstop, +20 % damage from data/rules/match.json).
setup: p1 character scenario_dummy
setup: p2 character scenario_dummy
setup: trade trade

frame 1: p1 2, 3, 6c
frame 1: p2 2, 3, 6d

frames 15-42: expect p1 entities = 1
frames 15-42: expect p2 entities = 1
frame 43: expect p1 event projectile_hit
frame 43: expect p2 event projectile_hit
frame 43: expect p1 event punish_counter
frame 43: expect p2 event punish_counter
frame 43: expect p1 damage = 600
frame 43: expect p2 damage = 720
frame 43: expect p1 state = hitstun
frame 43: expect p2 state = hitstun
frame 43: expect p1 hitstop = 13
frame 43: expect p2 hitstop = 14
